                                          Iterable (Interface)   //Iterable is the parent interface of Collection.

                                        Collection (Interface)                      Map (Separate Interface)

                List                    Set                            Queue
               ArrayList            HashSet                        PriorityQueue                     HashMap                  LinkedHashMap

              LinkedList            LinkedHashSet                  ArrayDeque                        TreeMap                    Hashtable
                                                
               Vector                TreeSet                          LinkedList
                                                
               Stack


                                    
                                    - ArrayList — Dynamic array; a good default choice for most list operations.
                                    - LinkedList — Doubly linked list; also supports queue and deque operations.
                                    - Vector — Legacy synchronized list.
                                    - Stack — Legacy LIFO stack implementation.


                Interview ke liye hierarchy ke important points
                Interface / Class	Key point
                Iterable	Enhanced for loop support
                Collection	List, Set, Queue ka parent interface
                List	Ordered, duplicates allowed
                Set	Unique elements
                Queue	Processing elements
                Deque	Dono ends se insertion/removal
                ArrayList	Dynamic array
                LinkedList	List aur Deque implement karta hai
                HashSet	Hash-based unique elements
                TreeSet	Sorted unique elements
                HashMap	Hash-based key-value storage
                Comparable / Comparator	Object sorting ke liye
                Yaad rakho: Vector ek legacy synchronized list hai aur Stack, Vector ko extend karta hai. 
                Modern code mein stack operations ke liye aksar ArrayDeque prefer kiya jata hai.
